1. PRODUCT IDENTITY

Product: BorrowBond

Tagline: Borrow anything. Secure every agreement.

Product description:

BorrowBond is an intelligent peer-to-peer marketplace where individuals, businesses and authorized AI agents can discover, rent and temporarily access physical and digital resources through transparent borrowing agreements, refundable collateral and NEAR-powered escrow.

BorrowBond has two connected marketplaces:

1. Physical resources — cameras, laptops, projectors, tools, equipment, bicycles and other belongings.
2. Digital resources — API access, computing capacity, licensed datasets, digital assets and other legitimately shareable digital resources.

Both marketplaces share one financial agreement and collateral system, but have different delivery, access, return and dispute workflows.

Core purpose: Make unused resources accessible, temporary borrowing easier, payments more accountable and digital resource access more programmable.

Do not change this central concept into a lending application for borrowing money. BorrowBond is about temporarily borrowing or renting resources, not taking personal loans.

