2. THE PRODUCT'S MAIN INNOVATION

Build around five connected capabilities:

A. Unified borrowing marketplace

Users can list, discover and borrow both physical and digital resources in one application.

B. AI Borrowing Agent

Users describe what they need in natural language. The agent searches listings, compares conditions, recommends suitable offers and prepares borrowing agreements.

C. AI Security Agent

A security layer checks spending permissions, provider reputation signals, unusual conditions, collateral and potentially suspicious listings.

D. NEAR programmable escrow

The smart contract locks rental fees and refundable collateral, manages agreement states and releases funds according to transparent settlement rules.

E. Temporary access management

For digital resources, BorrowBond can issue temporary credentials, enforce usage limits and revoke access when a rental expires.

The AI agent must perform genuine tool-based actions. It must not be a decorative chatbot.

