Allow users to configure:

- Maximum rental fee.
- Maximum collateral.
- Maximum total payment.
- Allowed resource categories.
- Maximum borrowing duration.
- Approved providers or excluded providers.
- Whether every booking requires manual confirmation.

Security rules

Use deterministic backend checks for critical spending limits. AI may identify risks and explain them, but must not override policy rules.

Treat all listing descriptions, provider text and external data as untrusted input. Prevent prompt injection from turning a listing into instructions for the agent.

Do not claim that the system guarantees scam detection or verifies real-world identity.

