Treat security as a core requirement.

- Never commit secrets, API keys, private keys or wallet credentials.
- Provide ".env.example" with placeholder variable names only.
- Keep secrets server-side.
- Validate inputs on both frontend and backend.
- Enforce authorization on every sensitive backend operation.
